--[[ NOSEY BRICK  -  FE brick animatronic (Delta / any executor)
  Rebuilt from the Nosey animatronic: same cutscene, crouch/stand, walk cycle, roar, slam, antenna sway.
  Built ONLY from your own unanchored, unwelded 3-stud bricks (1x1x3), exactly 44 of them.

  BRICK COUNT (counted in bricks, so it does not depend on brick size):
    Torso 4x2x2 = 16 | Head 3x2x1 = 6 | Arms 2 per side = 4 | Legs 8 per side = 16 | Antennas = 2   -> 44

  Buttons : Spawn/Dismiss | Control (WASD) | Target player (type a name) | Speed box (type any number)
  Abilities: Punch (F) | Roar (R) | Slam (G) | Disappear (V, press again to come back)
  GUI     : "N" circle button or RightControl opens/closes the panel; drag it by the title.
  FE      : colors/shockwaves/camera are LOCAL; the bricks themselves move for everyone. Bricks never collide.
]]

